          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "4. Solve the following problems:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.153,
            0.108,
            0.775,
            0.176
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(i) A cake recipe uses dry ingredients, namely 75 g of sugar for 420 g of all-purpose flour and 5 g of sodium hydrogencarbonate. Express the concentration of each component in the mixture using an appropriate method."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.176,
            0.774,
            0.211
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(ii) A brass alloy contains 70% copper by mass. Calculate the quantities of copper and zinc present in 120 g of brass."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.121,
            0.213,
            0.775,
            0.282
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "5. The label on a cooking oil pack says one litre (910 g). If this oil is mixed with water, will it form a separate layer? If so, which substance will be on top? How will you separate the two layers? Also, draw the diagram of the apparatus used."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.122,
            0.284,
            0.655,
            0.302
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "6. Assertion (A): Solutions do not exhibit the Tyndall effect."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.145,
            0.305,
            0.774,
            0.339
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Reason (R): The particles in solutions are larger than 100 nm, so they cannot scatter light."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.341,
            0.389,
            0.359
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Choose the correct option:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.153,
            0.36,
            0.719,
            0.378
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(i) Both A and R are true, and R is the correct explanation of A."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.148,
            0.378,
            0.748,
            0.395
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(ii) Both A and R are true, but R is not the correct explanation of A."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.144,
            0.394,
            0.394,
            0.411
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(iii) A is true, but R is false."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.145,
            0.411,
            0.395,
            0.428
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(iv) A is false, but R is true."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
